cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software or these derived data, please cite the article and this repository.
title: >-
  Stimulus-resolved modelling of human islet glucagon perifusion, analysis code
  and derived data
type: software
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and derived data for a stimulus-resolved hierarchical model of
  human islet perifusion curves from the Human Pancreas Analysis Program, with
  a left-censored likelihood for the assay floor, a construction null for
  conventional perifusion traits, cross-laboratory replication, a joint
  two-laboratory latent variable model and matched islet respirometry.
